# A graph planned in each form, then run: feed, take, step, take. The fixture node passes its
# input on, so a value shows at the output after the tick that ran it.
load_plugin {plugin}
put_graph pass {graphs}/pass.json
plan pass steps
plan pass blob
plan pass steps inspect
plan pass source
start pass
feed 1 in u32:41
take 1 out
step 1 1
take 1 out
take 1 out
feed 1 in u32:7
step 1 2
take 1 out
inspect run 1
inspect graph pass
stop 1 drain
